---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="Solace Studios is a solo indie development shop behind Repose: Sleep Sounds."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-20 sm:py-28">
    <div class="reveal">
      <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-repose-muted">About</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-black sm:text-5xl">Solace Studios</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal mt-10 space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-repose-muted">
      <p>
        Solace Studios is one person, not a studio in the traditional sense — the
        name is aspirational. Repose started as a personal project: an ambient
        sound app good enough to actually use every night, without the loop
        clicks, ad interruptions, or bloated feature lists that made existing
        options hard to stick with.
      </p>
      <p>
        Building it meant learning React Native and Swift from scratch, mostly
        by working through the problems Repose itself surfaced — gapless audio
        looping, lock-screen integration, and handling interruptions like phone
        calls and alarms cleanly turned out to be harder than expected, and each
        one became its own small research project.
      </p>
      <p>
        The goal isn't to compete with big meditation-app platforms. It's a
        focused tool that does one thing — ambient sound for sleep and rest —
        carefully, and gets out of your way.
      </p>
      <p>
        Questions, bug reports, and feature requests are all welcome directly
        at <a
          href="mailto:SolaceStudioDevs@protonmail.com"
          class="text-repose-text underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-80"
        >SolaceStudioDevs@protonmail.com</a> — a real person reads every email.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
